{
    "title": "Sago Mini World: Kids Games",
    "description": "AWARD-WINNING GAMES FOR KIDS\r\n\r\nDiscover a world of creative play with tons of award-winning games for kids in one app! Children aged 2-5 build, create, and explore with thoughtfully designed games for toddlers that spark imagination.\r\n\r\nJoin over 100 million parents and start your free trial today! \r\n\r\n*** Winner of a Parents' Choice Gold Award, Webby's Nomination, Academics' Choice Smart Media Award, Kidscreen Award, and a W3 Mobile App Design Award. Featured in the New York Times, Guardian, and USA Today. ***\r\n\r\nCREATIVE PLAY & SKILL-BUILDING GAMES FOR KIDS\r\n\r\nChildren are free to explore and play their way \u2013 the only limit is their imagination! Open-ended play means there are no rules in these games for toddlers. \r\n\r\nHow children engage with these games for kids is completely up to them. Delight in safe, creative games for kids that encourage self-expression, empathy, and confidence.\r\n\r\nSAFE, POSITIVE GAMES FOR KIDS\r\n\r\nCOPPA and kidSAFE-certified and no in-app purchases or ads for subscribers, Sago Mini World provides games for kids that parents can feel good about. Designed for intuitive play, it\u2019s easy and safe for kids to explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nEXPLORE WITH YOUR OWN SAGO MINI FRIENDS\r\n\r\nExplore new worlds in these games for kids, from outer space to a fantasy castle! There are tons of kids animal games, including mini dog games for kids. Plus, children can turn themselves into a Sago Mini character!\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\n\u2022 Unlimited access to hundreds of games for kids, with countless worlds in one app\r\n\u2022 Play pre-downloaded games offline without WiFi\r\n\u2022 Updated monthly with new content, baby games, games for kids, and games for toddlers\r\n\u2022 Use one subscription across multiple devices\r\n\u2022 Subscribers get early access to all new games for kids, games for toddlers, and children aged 2-5\r\n\u2022 COPPA and kidSAFE-certified \u2013 safe and easy games for toddlers\r\n\u2022 No third-party advertising\r\n\u2022 The perfect gift for kids, toddlers, and children\r\n\r\nSago Mini World is part of Piknik \u2013 a subscription bundle to the best kids apps! Get full access to the worlds best games for kids from Toca Boca and Sago Mini with an Unlimited Plan.\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIPTION BENEFITS\r\n\r\n\u2022 Try before you buy! Download the World app to start your free trial.\r\n\u2022 Use one subscription across multiple devices for easy access to award-winning games for kids\r\n\u2022 Cancel anytime with no hassle or fees.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy\r\n\r\nSago Mini is committed to protecting your privacy and the privacy of your children. We adhere to the strict guidelines set forth by COPPA (Children\u2019s Online Privacy Protection Rule) & KidSAFE, which ensure the protection of your child\u2019s information.\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: https://playpiknik.link/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of use: https://playpiknik.link/terms-of-use/\r\n\r\nAbout Sago Mini\r\n\r\nSago Mini is an award-winning company devoted to play. We make apps, games and toys for preschoolers worldwide. Toys that seed imagination and grow wonder. We bring thoughtful design to life. For kids. For parents. For giggles.\r\n\r\nFind us on Instagram, Youtube, and TikTok at @sagomini.\r\n\r\nQuestions about our games for kids? Give the Sago Mini World team a shout at worldsupport@sagomini.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "AWARD-WINNING GAMES FOR KIDS<br><br>Discover a world of creative play with tons of award-winning games for kids in one app! Children aged 2-5 build, create, and explore with thoughtfully designed games for toddlers that spark imagination.<br><br>Join over 100 million parents and start your free trial today! <br><br>*** Winner of a Parents&#39; Choice Gold Award, Webby&#39;s Nomination, Academics&#39; Choice Smart Media Award, Kidscreen Award, and a W3 Mobile App Design Award. Featured in the New York Times, Guardian, and USA Today. ***<br><br>CREATIVE PLAY &amp; SKILL-BUILDING GAMES FOR KIDS<br><br>Children are free to explore and play their way \u2013 the only limit is their imagination! Open-ended play means there are no rules in these games for toddlers. <br><br>How children engage with these games for kids is completely up to them. Delight in safe, creative games for kids that encourage self-expression, empathy, and confidence.<br><br>SAFE, POSITIVE GAMES FOR KIDS<br><br>COPPA and kidSAFE-certified and no in-app purchases or ads for subscribers, Sago Mini World provides games for kids that parents can feel good about. Designed for intuitive play, it\u2019s easy and safe for kids to explore the world on their own.<br><br>EXPLORE WITH YOUR OWN SAGO MINI FRIENDS<br><br>Explore new worlds in these games for kids, from outer space to a fantasy castle! There are tons of kids animal games, including mini dog games for kids. Plus, children can turn themselves into a Sago Mini character!<br><br>FEATURES<br><br>\u2022 Unlimited access to hundreds of games for kids, with countless worlds in one app<br>\u2022 Play pre-downloaded games offline without WiFi<br>\u2022 Updated monthly with new content, baby games, games for kids, and games for toddlers<br>\u2022 Use one subscription across multiple devices<br>\u2022 Subscribers get early access to all new games for kids, games for toddlers, and children aged 2-5<br>\u2022 COPPA and kidSAFE-certified \u2013 safe and easy games for toddlers<br>\u2022 No third-party advertising<br>\u2022 The perfect gift for kids, toddlers, and children<br><br>Sago Mini World is part of Piknik \u2013 a subscription bundle to the best kids apps! Get full access to the worlds best games for kids from Toca Boca and Sago Mini with an Unlimited Plan.<br><br>SUBSCRIPTION BENEFITS<br><br>\u2022 Try before you buy! Download the World app to start your free trial.<br>\u2022 Use one subscription across multiple devices for easy access to award-winning games for kids<br>\u2022 Cancel anytime with no hassle or fees.<br><br>Privacy Policy<br><br>Sago Mini is committed to protecting your privacy and the privacy of your children. We adhere to the strict guidelines set forth by COPPA (Children\u2019s Online Privacy Protection Rule) &amp; KidSAFE, which ensure the protection of your child\u2019s information.<br><br>Privacy policy: https://playpiknik.link/privacy-policy<br>Terms of use: https://playpiknik.link/terms-of-use/<br><br>About Sago Mini<br><br>Sago Mini is an award-winning company devoted to play. We make apps, games and toys for preschoolers worldwide. Toys that seed imagination and grow wonder. We bring thoughtful design to life. For kids. For parents. For giggles.<br><br>Find us on Instagram, Youtube, and TikTok at @sagomini.<br><br>Questions about our games for kids? Give the Sago Mini World team a shout at worldsupport@sagomini.com.",
